    "main_topic": [
      {
        "h_title": "Khao Sok Floating Bungalows: 14 Raft Houses, 4 Tiers, One Lake",
        "main_title": "Floating Bungalows, Khao Sok Lake",
        "author": "Khao Sok Lake L.T.D.",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Deep inside Khao Sok National Park, on the glassy surface of Cheow Lan Lake, float 14 raft houses unlike anything else in Thailand. Limestone karst towers rise from the water on every side. The jungle presses to the shore. At night, the only sounds are the lake and the forest.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "These are not hotel rooms with a lake view. They are rooms on the lake — tethered to the water, open to the elements, surrounded by one of the oldest rainforests on earth. Older than the Amazon. Older than the Congo.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Khao Sok Lake Co., Ltd. is the only tour operator physically based on Cheow Lan Lake. Not in Khao Sok village — on the lake itself. We have worked with every raft house here for 12 years, and nobody knows these options better. All 14 floating bungalows fall into one of four tiers. Choose yours below.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Type 1",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Type 2",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Type 3",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
